WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The word BLUE is painted in orange.
Your task is to name the ink.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
That hesitation is not evidence
of a weak mind.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In 1935, Stroop measured interference
between reading and color naming.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Suggestion sometimes changed that task
in controlled experiments.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
In one study, hypnotic induction
was not needed for the reduction.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
But research is not product proof.
Ask what was actually tested.
